    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run in Fugue Shot presents a series of unique dreamscapes, filled with randomized and increasingly difficult encounters, puzzles, and challenges that will test your abilities to their limit. Can you overcome the ever-shifting landscape of this liminal and surreal world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test Your Skills Across a Variety of Minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a randomized lineup of over 10 distinct minigame types - each offering unique depth, strategy, and variety. <strong>No two runs are exactly alike</strong>. Take on physics puzzles, bullet-hell time trials,  reaction-based challenges, and more as encounters grow increasingly challenging over the course of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/391ba288702f6a4d370c74bf724eb70d.poster.avif?t=1755197324\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/391ba288702f6a4d370c74bf724eb70d.webm?t=1755197324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up Your Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain any of dozens of unique items to impact your run and warp your playstyle.\u00a0Discover powerful synergies and stat augmentations to create truly unique builds, allowing for emergent gameplay and a constantly shifting experience. Purchase modifications to upcoming levels to shift the run to your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/6d1004a296eeb0aae087ddc979830c91.poster.avif?t=1755197324\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/6d1004a296eeb0aae087ddc979830c91.webm?t=1755197324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy an Eerily Beautiful World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning pixel art and visual effects compliment a hypnotic and meditative soundtrack to create a surreal, dream-like atmosphere to lose yourself in.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run in Fugue Shot presents a series of unique dreamscapes, filled with randomized and increasingly difficult encounters, puzzles, and challenges that will test your abilities to their limit. Can you overcome the ever-shifting landscape of this liminal and surreal world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test Your Skills Across a Variety of Minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a randomized lineup of over 10 distinct minigame types - each offering unique depth, strategy, and variety. <strong>No two runs are exactly alike</strong>. Take on physics puzzles, bullet-hell time trials,  reaction-based challenges, and more as encounters grow increasingly challenging over the course of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/391ba288702f6a4d370c74bf724eb70d.poster.avif?t=1755197324\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/391ba288702f6a4d370c74bf724eb70d.webm?t=1755197324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up Your Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain any of dozens of unique items to impact your run and warp your playstyle.\u00a0Discover powerful synergies and stat augmentations to create truly unique builds, allowing for emergent gameplay and a constantly shifting experience. Purchase modifications to upcoming levels to shift the run to your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/6d1004a296eeb0aae087ddc979830c91.poster.avif?t=1755197324\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538440/extras/6d1004a296eeb0aae087ddc979830c91.webm?t=1755197324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy an Eerily Beautiful World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning pixel art and visual effects compliment a hypnotic and meditative soundtrack to create a surreal, dream-like atmosphere to lose yourself in.</p>",
